<item>
            <title>[LU-20342] Enhance lnet_selftest with rx zerocopy</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20342</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Boost the lst by introducing an option to skip data copy on the receiving side. This can improve the network throughput by ~10%.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
